📌OBJECTIVE
This lab apply common encryption and hashing techniques to ensure confidentiality, integrity, and authentication. 
Message Digest Algorithm 5 (MD5) and Secure Hash Algorithm 1 (SHA1) hash algorithms will be applied to a text file on a Linux virtual machine (VM).

For encryption the GNU Privacy Guard (GnuPG) will create a key pair and encrypt the message. These key pairs will be utilized to send secure 
messages between two user accounts.  

📈 SKILLS Learned
* How to create a MD5sum and SHA1sum hash string
* How to ouput and create a new text file with the hash string
* How to generate GnuPG keys
* How to share GnuPG keys
* Encrypt and decrypt a message
* Utilize AES256

